        "text": "The entire complex is quite big but it's its actually easy to get around it. And don;t get impacted by how not exciting it looks from the airport road - once inside, you will experience a lot! \nWe took a guide who helped us to understand more of these important rituals and was also helpful to negotiate with the locals who either wanted to sell us something or needed a gift for photos (mainly applies to the Holy Men). \nWe spent about half a day wandering around after which we walked for 30mins to the Boddnath stupa for another half day. That way we explored Hindu traditions in the morning and Buddhist traditions in the afternoon. That was an amazing day!",
