        "title": "Very special experience to come here in the evening",
        "text": "Very special experience to come here in the evening around 6-7pm when they hold the ceremonies and cremating of the bodies.\nLots of people all lined up on the steps to watch, and 3 men perform a ceremony with bells and incense, then each family take their dead to the river (apparently to see if they come back to life), and if not, then take them to one of the many platforms for cremating.\nFelt very privileged to see such a sight and apparently it is much better / more atmosphere and more going on in the evening.",
